# Check every text file out with LF on every platform.
# The build and its audit gates read split/ sources byte-for-byte (literal "\n" anchors,
# sha256-pinned registries), so a CRLF checkout on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) aborts
# `pnpm build` at audit-first-aid-age-v1 and would rewrite the built index.html.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted.
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.mp4  binary
